# Accepted Trivy findings. Every entry needs a justification and a pointer
# to where the decision is recorded; revisit when that decision changes.

# KSV-0041: ClusterRole has access to 'secrets'.
# The operator holds cluster-wide get/create/update/patch/delete (no
# list/watch) on Secrets: get to read connection tokens and CA bundles by
# name (only Secrets labeled authentik.io/connection=true are used), writes
# to render credential Secrets into a provider's own namespace, never
# touching a Secret it does not control. Decision and threat model:
# docs/design/scope.md ("Decided: connection model"), TASK-04. Per-namespace
# RBAC as an install option is a planned follow-up.
KSV-0041
